This product bundles no third-party source. It depends at runtime on the
packages declared in pyproject.toml, and on two data artifacts that are not
declared as dependencies and must be installed separately:

  * spaCy's en_core_web_sm model, distributed under the MIT License by
    Explosion AI (https://github.com/explosion/spacy-models).
  * The NLTK WordNet corpus, distributed under the WordNet 3.0 License by
    Princeton University (https://wordnet.princeton.edu/license-and-commercial-use).

Neither is redistributed here. Each is downloaded by the installing user under
its own terms.
